{"id":"n21891-2-7","stage":5,"title":"왕자 · 王子","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21891-2-7-1","ko":"이모, 우리 집에 언제 오셨어요?","zh":"阿姨，您什么时候来我们家的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이모,","meaning":"阿姨，姨妈","explanation":"이모：阿姨，姨妈。","readings":[{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71153","senseId":"1","lemma":"이모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"오셨어요?","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오셨어요","audio":"/audio/c9db67d1006b18e0b44d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfd6511ae5195e09","term":"이모","zh":"阿姨，姨妈","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3","entryId":"71153","definition":"用于指称或称呼母亲的姐姐或妹妹。","pronunciation":["이모"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/97f94ed7ca3910d915e2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21891-2-7-2","ko":"우리 왕자 보고 싶어서 좀 전에 놀러 왔지.","zh":"因为想看看我们的小王子，所以刚才就过来玩了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我，我们","explanation":"우리：我，我们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"3","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"왕자","meaning":"王子","explanation":"왕자：王子。","readings":[{"term":"왕자","audio":"/audio/2bc7fba19f1b8bed1947.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21891","senseId":"2","lemma":"왕자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왕자","audio":"/audio/2bc7fba19f1b8bed1947.mp3"}},{"text":"보고","meaning":"占，看","explanation":"보다：占，看；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"14","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}},{"text":"싶어서","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싶어서","audio":"/audio/01c2c48b3073c6e67a29.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一会儿","explanation":"좀：一会儿。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"2","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀러","audio":"/audio/56ad7f4b97efb1434426.mp3"}},{"text":"왔지.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔지","audio":"/audio/30d1e06f5e1b21e898aa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我，我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"2bc7fba19f1b8bed","term":"왕자","zh":"王子","audio":"/audio/2bc7fba19f1b8bed1947.mp3","entryId":"21891","definition":"呼叫男孩子的昵称。","pronunciation":["왕자"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"占，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用算卦预知将来的事情或命运。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"要，想","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":"表示有做前面内容的意图或欲望。","pronunciation":["십따"]},{"id"